  "instructions": [
    "Preheat the comal over medium heat",
    "In a small bowl, whisk together honey, lemon juice, ginger, turmeric, salt, and black pepper",
    "Add the diced melons to the comal and cook for 5 minutes",
    "Add the butter to the comal and let it melt",
    "Pour the honey and spice mixture over the melons and butter",
    "Stir everything together and cook for an additional 5 minutes",
    "Use a sous-vide machine to warm the mixture to 160 degrees Fahrenheit",
    "Serve the Nourishing Buttery Croatian Melon Skillet hot and enjoy"
  ],
